  {
    "cmd": "",
    "title": {
      "zh-Hans": "按结果分级的标准回复",
      "zh-Hant": "按結果分級的標準回覆",
      "en": "Standard outcome replies",
      "ja": "結果別の標準返信"
    },
    "category": "COC",
    "sources": [
      "Dice!Next"
    ],
    "example": "",
    "desc": {
      "zh-Hans": "按成功等级设置完整检定回复；其他检定未单独设置时继承同等级。留空则保持各指令原有文案。特殊成功供 BRP 使用，平局供对抗使用。",
      "zh-Hant": "按成功等級設定完整檢定回覆；其他檢定未單獨設定時繼承同等級。留空則保持各指令原有文案。特殊成功供 BRP 使用，平局供對抗使用。",
      "en": "Full replies per outcome, inherited by checks without a specific reply. Empty slots keep original command text. Special is for BRP; tie is for opposed checks.",
      "ja": "結果別の完全な返信を設定します。個別設定のない判定は同段階の標準返信を継承し、空欄なら元の文面を使います。特殊成功は BRP、引き分けは対抗用です。"
    },
    "replyPrefixes": [
      "dice.outcome.standard."
    ],
    "replyKeys": [
      "dice.outcome.standard.critical",
      "dice.outcome.standard.extreme",
      "dice.outcome.standard.hard",
      "dice.outcome.standard.regular",
      "dice.outcome.standard.failure",
      "dice.outcome.standard.fumble"
    ],
    "replyExamples": {
      "dice.outcome.standard.critical": ".ra(1)60",
      "dice.outcome.standard.extreme": ".ra(10)60",
      "dice.outcome.standard.hard": ".ra(25)60",
      "dice.outcome.standard.regular": ".ra(50)60",
      "dice.outcome.standard.failure": ".ra(80)60",
      "dice.outcome.standard.fumble": ".ra(100)60"
    }
  },
  {
    "cmd": ".strRollSkill/.strRollCriticalSuccess",
    "title": {
      "zh-Hans": "旧版检定文本兼容",
      "zh-Hant": "舊版檢定文本相容",
